              "type": "math",
              "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}&>\\frac{1}{5}\\\\\\log\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)&>\\log\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)\\\\\\frac{\\log\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)}{\\log\\left(\\frac{1}{5}\\right)}&>1\\\\\\frac{\\log(1)-\\log(2)}{\\log(1)-\\log(5)}&>1\\\\\\frac{-\\log(2)}{-\\log(5)}&>1\\\\\\frac{\\log(2)}{\\log(5)}&>1\\\\\\log(2)&>\\log(5)\\\\2&>5\\\\&\\text{quod erat demonstrandum}\\end{aligned}",
